To visit another town,{cmd:7F0306}
you need to take the train.{cmd:7F04}
Head to the {cmd:7F504BA00007}station,{cmd:7F0304}
and hop aboard,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000007}But hey,{cmd:7F0306}
without a {cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak,
they won't{cmd:7F0304}
let you ride,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Don't forget
to bring one,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}When you visit another town,{cmd:7F0306}
send letters{cmd:7F0304}
to the people living there!{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}Got secrets you can't put
on the {cmd:7F504BA0000E}bulletin board?{cmd:7F0306}
Then{cmd:7F0308} write a letter,
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}I wonder{cmd:7F0304}
{cmd:7F09000014}if I'll get any letters{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F0304}.
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}Do any of your friends{cmd:7F0306}
live outside {cmd:7F2F},{cmd:7F0304}
in some other town{cmd:7F0304}?
{cmd:7F0900000B}Well,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}?{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}If they do,{cmd:7F0308}
you can visit{cmd:7F0304}
your friend's town
for a change!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Or{cmd:7F0306} your friend can
come to {cmd:7F2F}
and visit you,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}When you want to
visit another town,{cmd:7F04}
head to the {cmd:7F504BA00007}station{cmd:7F0304}
and take the train,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Buu{cmd:7F0304}uu{cmd:7F0304}ut,{cmd:7F0308}
you need a {cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak
or they won't{cmd:7F0304}
let you ride,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}I guess{cmd:7F0308}
it's sort of like
a ticket,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F00}

You need the Pak you used
to come to {cmd:7F2F},{cmd:7F0306}
with the {cmd:7F50C35F0010}same travel data
on that {cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Otherwise,{cmd:7F0306}
I can't let you leave town!
Eek!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}I can't save to a different
{cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak,{cmd:7F0306}
or to a {cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak
that's been saved over!{cmd:7F0308}{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Why, you ask?{cmd:7F0308}
It's my job to
prevent {cmd:7F509114A509}smuggling!
Eek!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Connect the proper
{cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak,{cmd:7F0308}
then come see me again.
Eek{cmd:7F0302} ee{cmd:7F0302}eek!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}Do you know what falls
on the second Monday
of October{cmd:7F0308}?
What {cmd:7F0900000B}day is it?{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}Of course you know.{cmd:7F0308}
You never miss a holiday!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}Oh, excuse me.{cmd:7F0308}
That's not what
I meant to say,{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}It's Sports Day,
isn't it?{cmd:7F030F}
There's a sports fair in
{cmd:7F2F} too,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}It's at the {cmd:7F504BA0000C}shrine plaza,
so{cmd:7F030F} why not
come take a look,
{cmd:7F1A}?{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}I'm sure you'll see
something entertaining,{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F09000015}I knew you'd know!{cmd:7F030F}
That's right,{cmd:7F0306}
it's Sports Day,
{cmd:7F0308}{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}The Fall Sports Fair
is that day!{cmd:7F030C}
It starts at 9:00 a.m.{cmd:7F0304}
at the shrine plaza.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Of course,{cmd:7F0306}
you'll be taking part,
won't you?{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}Sports Day used to fall
on{cmd:7F0302} October 10th,{cmd:7F0304}
but now{cmd:7F0304}{cmd:7F030C} it's October's
second Monday.{cmd:7F0304}{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}Well,{cmd:7F0304} that's the day
we hold our sports fair.{cmd:7F0314}
That takes care of
autumn exercise,{cmd:7F0308} eh?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F090000FF}It's at the {cmd:7F504BA0000C}shrine plaza,{cmd:7F0304}
all day long,{cmd:7F0308} {cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}The second Monday
in October...{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F0900000F}{cmd:7F0317}I don't know what date
that is{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}Anyway,{cmd:7F030C}
come to the shrine plaza
at least once that day,
{cmd:7F0308}{cmd:7F1A}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0900000E}Then you'll see
how cool I can be,
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F0310}
{cmd:7F09000017}Probably{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}Hey,{cmd:7F0308} are you
paying back{cmd:7F0304}
what you owe Tom Nook?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000016}Even a little at a time
helps.{cmd:7F0308} Otherwise,{cmd:7F0304}
your house will stay
tiny forever,{cmd:7F0308} {cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F00}
